<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63462" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπαίνω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλίπηνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.357
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλίπᾱνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Axionic.
					4.10
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλιπήνατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					9.9
				</span></i>
			; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπηνάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.273
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>):— 
				Pass.
			, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-λιπανθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελίπασμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Damocr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.225
			</span></i>:—<i>oil, anoint</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κεφαλὴν ἐλαίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῶτα μύροις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anaxil.
					18.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρᾶς ὕπο σῶμα λ.
			ἱδρῶτι</span> Aspasia ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.219c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσμασι σῶμα λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Axionic.
				</span></i>
			 l. c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Osl.</u>
				1.212
			</span></i>; of <i>oiling</i> the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνοι</span> in a machine to preserve them, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				61.37
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>anoint oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
			</span></i> l. c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			rivers, <i>make fat, enrich</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώραν ὕδασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					575
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				454
			</span></i> (lyr.); of Sciron swallowed by a sea-tortoise, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέλυος . . ἐλιπήνατο λαιμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
				</span></i>
			 l. c. (s. v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., of the eyes, <i>glisten</i> with tears, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				120
			</span></i>.</div>
